<title>HONG KONG: Trading in DC Finance shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in DC Finance shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of DC Finance (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shares of financing and property investment concern rose HK$0.11 to end at HK$1.95 on Tuesday on volume of 69.79 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
